# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This matters more than usual here: the single-file build inlines src/styles.css
# and src/script.js verbatim, and the build script asserts the result is
# byte-reproducible. If git rewrote those files to CRLF on checkout, a build on
# Windows would produce a different file from a build on Linux for identical
# input. Forcing LF everywhere keeps `git clone` + build deterministic on any
# platform, which is also what makes the artifact safe to copy to other machines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.woff2 binary
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.pdf     binary
